222	  // The whole support transcript, plus the name/email the visitor gave. The
223	  // `?visitorId=` in the URL is the ONLY thing scoping it, which makes the URL
224	  // itself the secret — precisely the shape a shared cache must never store.
225	  //
226	  // `typing.agent` tells the widget whether a support agent is composing a reply
